# Per-machine tool permissions. Deliberately untracked: committing it grants every clone
# whatever it allows, and a wildcard like `Bash(npm run *)` then covers `npm run deploy`,
# which publishes to GitHub Pages. Permissions are a property of a machine and its operator,
# not of the repository.
